      "problem": "$\\frac{ab+3b}{5a+15}=$",
      "worked_solution": "We factor the numerator and denominator and cancel any factors that they have in common.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{ab+3b}{5a+15} & =\\frac{b(a+3)}{5(a+3)} \\\\  & =\\frac{b\\cancel{(a+3)}}{5\\cancel{(a+3)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{b}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
